		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="424" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">处于侧后方时，造物一个转身，顺便造成<span color="#b8b8b8">25%</span><span>伤害。<br/>「命曜之姿」强化：攻击造成</span><span color="#ff9999">火元素</span><span>伤害，且伤害倍率提升，造成</span><span color="#ff9999">65%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="1015" height="200" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">造物升空，消耗<span color="#ffdfbf">18%生命值</span><span>，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">缓慢</span><span>展开等量的</span><span textDecoration="underline">余温护罩</span><span>，并进入「命曜之姿」状态。护罩展开期间可受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响。<br/>该状态下，造物每造成一次伤害，都会为自身恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3%生命值(除爆发伤害外)</span><span>，恢复总量至多不超过所消耗的生命值，恢复行为可受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响。若造物命中</span><span color="#ffdfbf">角色护盾</span><span>，或命中</span><span color="#ffdfbf">处于无敌帧下的角色</span><span>，则</span><span color="#ffdfbf">不会触发恢复效果</span><span>。<br/>当生命值不足以消耗时，造物会尽量转换剩余的生命值成等量的护罩。护罩移除后进入</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>的虚弱状态，直至再次开启护罩。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1087" width="438" height="143" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">造物移至场地中央，将火焰盛放的花冠裹回蓓蕾，随后令其猛烈绽放，造成<span color="#ff9999">150%</span><span>伤害，退出「命曜之姿」状态并移除护罩。若命中玩家则恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15%生命值</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/不灭衍生造物.assets/Image_14.png')" x="1391" y="137">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/不灭衍生造物.assets/Image_15.png')" x="720" y="394">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/不灭衍生造物.assets/Image_16.png')" x="720" y="1001">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="899" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ad4218" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ad4218">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="424" height="143" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">造物进行左右双翼挥扫、转身三段攻击，分别造成<span color="#b8b8b8">50%,50%,70%</span><span>伤害。<br/>「命曜之姿」强化：攻击造成</span><span color="#ff9999">火元素</span><span>伤害，且伤害倍率提升，分别造成</span><span color="#ff9999">65%,<br/>65%,90%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="799" width="437" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，造物朝玩家冲击而来，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害，仅在「命曜之姿」状态下施放。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/不灭衍生造物.assets/Image_17.png')" x="720" y="137">
		</BitmapImage>
