		<RichText x="9" y="1077" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">虚弱</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1128" width="444" height="97" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">余温护罩：层页生命护罩，共<span color="#ffdfbf">9</span><span>层，每层</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2%生命值</span><span>，破坏后进入虚弱状态，约</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>后再次展开护罩。展开时，完全填满护罩需</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2s</span><span>。</span><span color="#ffdfbf">(仅大世界)</span><span>再次展开的护罩仅有</span><span color="#ffdfbf">4.5</span><span>层，同时，第</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2/3/4/<br/>&gt;4</span><span>次展开护罩时的生命值恢复量为原来的</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%/25%/12.5%/<br/>10%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
