				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「命曜之姿」：生成护罩时会倒扣<span color="#ffdfbf">2</span><span>层；恢复的生命值将</span><span color="#ffdfbf">立即扣除</span><span>，等于回血失效。</span></p>
